    </figure>

    <p><a href="#chapter-4" class="chapter-link">See Chapter 4: Score Ring</a> for complete file management details</p>

    <h4>2. Choose Your Layout</h4>
    <p>Once your score is open, tap the inner ring's Layout cell. The outer ring will show 4 layout options:</p>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Book:</strong> Animated page-flipping book simulation (best for reading)</li>
        <li><strong>Horizontal:</strong> Scroll pages left-to-right (great for rehearsal)</li>
        <li><strong>Vertical:</strong> Scroll pages top-to-bottom (ideal for smartphones)</li>
        <li><strong>Table:</strong> See all pages at once in a grid (useful for page management)</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Tap any layout cell to activate the layout. Drag out from the cell to open a configuration panel. Use a two-finger pinch-and-pan gesture on the score to resize and reposition.</p>

    <figure>
