    <h3>Practice Tools</h3>
    <p>Tap the inner ring's More cell to access a suite of musician's practice tools. Most of these panels can be detached from their headers and positioned anywhere on screen for convenient access while practicing:</p>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Metronome:</strong> Animated metronome with traditional pendulum or conducting patterns. Tap to set tempo, or use the panel controls for precise BPM settings.</li>
        <li><strong>Stopwatch:</strong> Session timer with lap/split.</li>
        <li><strong>Clock:</strong> Analog wall clock display to keep track of time during practice sessions.</li>
        <li><strong>Piano:</strong> Playable 5-octave keyboard with configurable pitch (A4 frequency), historical temperaments (Equal, Meantone, etc.), tuning mode for the beats method, and a YIN-based pitch detector that displays detected notes and cents deviation for electronic tuner functionality.</li>
        <li><strong>Review:</strong> Record the last ~30 seconds of audio/video with instant replay. Visualize your playing with waveform and spectrogram displays. Perfect for quick practice assessment.</li>
